  "task": "I'm handling a passenger injury incident from yesterday's downtown bus accident and need your assistance with several tasks: first, obtaining precise crash site location details and real-time service status during the incident; second, attaching witness photos to the report before legally certifying it; and finally, checking refund eligibility for affected riders, updating our case thread, and notifying everyone about compensation procedures."
